#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:1 86556b5900354c619d385edff84db1b4
msgid "快速上手"
msgstr "Getting started"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:3 384c31a11fcb4a2ba93b5d4b9c68857f
msgid "UniKT 是一个基于 PyTorch 和 PyTorch Geometric 构建的统一知识追踪研究实验框架。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT is a unified research and experimentation framework for knowledge "
"tracing, built on PyTorch and PyTorch Geometric."

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:5 449bd1cbeb524142ac1025a090a37bd7
msgid "什么是知识追踪"
msgstr "What is knowledge tracing"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:7 fb1cea63edf24eacb09f865f9c986233
msgid "知识追踪是对学习者的知识状态随时间进行建模的任务，基于其历史交互数据（回答的题目、练习的技能以及正确性结果）。其目标是预测学习者在未来题目上的表现，从而实现个性化学习。"
msgstr ""
"Knowledge tracing is the task of modeling a learner's knowledge state "
"over time based on their historical interaction data (questions answered,"
" skills practiced, and correctness outcomes). Its goal is to predict the "
"learner's future performance on questions, enabling personalized "
"learning."

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:9 0624dce780924bf1b343d4424bac2c79
msgid "UniKT 提供的功能"
msgstr "What UniKT provides"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:11 28e66c2891de4da4a6ed49f5b29f3a71
msgid "UniKT 提供从数据到评估的完整流程："
msgstr "UniKT covers the complete pipeline from data to evaluation:"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:13 c941ac4fb0024335ad3501cd8510ab54
msgid "**统一 API**：使用相同的 CLI 和训练器 API 训练任何模型"
msgstr "**Unified API**: train any model with the same CLI and trainer API"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:14 3c1b8b23fe9348f99a823fc9b3d9bd4e
msgid ""
"**35 "
"个内置模型**：覆盖图神经网络（GKT、GIKT、SGKT、DyGKT、HDHKT）和序列/注意力架构（DKT、AKT、SimpleKT）等方向"
msgstr ""
"**35 built-in models**: covering graph neural networks (GKT, GIKT, SGKT, "
"DyGKT, HDHKT) and sequential/attention architectures (DKT, AKT, "
"SimpleKT), among others"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:15 43a6b5f9cae94775832d84ff2c2365ea
msgid ""
"**11 "
"个支持的数据集**：ASSISTments（2009/2012/2015/2017）、Algebra（2005/2006）、Bridge2006"
"、EdNet-KT1、Junyi、NIPS2020_T34、Slepemapy"
msgstr ""
"**11 supported datasets**: ASSISTments (2009/2012/2015/2017), Algebra "
"(2005/2006), Bridge2006, EdNet-KT1, Junyi, NIPS2020_T34, and Slepemapy"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:16 9a521099367640d490bbbc6212e6d5c9
msgid "**实验管理**：K 折交叉验证、超参数搜索（Optuna）"
msgstr ""
"**Experiment management**: K-fold cross validation, hyperparameter search"
" (Optuna)"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:18 164c40375eb34a01a0b2e98c930dd764
msgid "框架设计"
msgstr "Framework design"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:20 8fb76d235b8e416d8b7b5f1b111e3543
msgid "UniKT 通过装饰器自动发现模型、训练器、数据源和配置——只需在代码中添加一行装饰器，无需手动编辑注册文件。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT auto-discovers models, trainers, data sources, and configurations "
"via decorators — just add a single decorator line in your code, with no "
"need to manually edit registration files."

